<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E17Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sim\mathcal{N}\left(\frac{1}{\sqrt{\alpha_{k}\alpha_{k-1}}}\bm{\tau}^{k}-\frac{1-\alpha_{k}}{\sqrt{(1-\bar{\alpha}_{k})\alpha_{k}\alpha_{k-1}}}\epsilon_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{k},k)-\frac{1-\alpha_{k-1}}{\sqrt{(1-\bar{\alpha}_{k-1})\alpha_{k-1}}}\epsilon_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{k-1},k-1),\right." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>(</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mi>𝝉</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mi>ϵ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝝉</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mi>ϵ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>𝝉</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sim\mathcal{N}\left(\frac{1}{\sqrt{\alpha_{k}\alpha_{k-1}}}\bm{\tau}^{k}-\frac{1-\alpha_{k}}{\sqrt{(1-\bar{\alpha}_{k})\alpha_{k}\alpha_{k-1}}}\epsilon_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{k},k)-\frac{1-\alpha_{k-1}}{\sqrt{(1-\bar{\alpha}_{k-1})\alpha_{k-1}}}\epsilon_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{k-1},k-1),\right.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E17Xc" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E17Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left.\left(\frac{\sigma_{k}^{2}}{\alpha_{k-1}}+\sigma_{k-1}^{2}\right)\mathbf{I}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="1.000em">OPEN</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐈</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left.\left(\frac{\sigma_{k}^{2}}{\alpha_{k-1}}+\sigma_{k-1}^{2}\right)\mathbf{I}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.5.1" class="ltx_text">By repeating the denoising process for <math id="A2.p2.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> iterations, we can ultimately obtain a closed-form representation of the denoised data <math id="A2.p2.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\bm{\tau}}^{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝝉</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\bm{\tau}}^{0}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
<table id="A2.E18" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A2.E18X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E18X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\widehat{\bm{\tau}}^{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝝉</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\widehat{\bm{\tau}}^{0}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E18X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{\sqrt{\prod_{i=1}^{k}\alpha_{i}}}\bm{\tau}^{k}-\sum_{i=1}^{k}\frac{1-\alpha_{i}}{\sqrt{(1-\bar{\alpha}_{i})\prod_{j=1}^{i}\alpha_{j}}}\epsilon_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{i},i)+\sqrt{\sigma_{1}^{2}+\sum_{i=2}^{k}\frac{\sigma_{i}^{2}}{\prod_{j=1}^{i-1}\alpha_{j}}}\bar{\epsilon}_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝉</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>i</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝝉</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo mathsize="0.700em">,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mrow><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{\sqrt{\prod_{i=1}^{k}\alpha_{i}}}\bm{\tau}^{k}-\sum_{i=1}^{k}\frac{1-\alpha_{i}}{\sqrt{(1-\bar{\alpha}_{i})\prod_{j=1}^{i}\alpha_{j}}}\epsilon_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{i},i)+\sqrt{\sigma_{1}^{2}+\sum_{i=2}^{k}\frac{\sigma_{i}^{2}}{\prod_{j=1}^{i-1}\alpha_{j}}}\bar{\epsilon}_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E18Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E18Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1}{\sqrt{\bar{\alpha}_{k}}}\bm{\tau}^{k}-\sum_{i=1}^{k}\frac{1-\alpha_{i}}{\sqrt{(1-\bar{\alpha}_{i})\bar{\alpha}_{i}}}\epsilon_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{i},i)+\sqrt{\sigma_{1}^{2}+\sum_{i=2}^{k}\frac{\sigma_{i}^{2}}{\bar{\alpha}_{i-1}}}\bar{\epsilon}_{1}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝉</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝝉</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1}{\sqrt{\bar{\alpha}_{k}}}\bm{\tau}^{k}-\sum_{i=1}^{k}\frac{1-\alpha_{i}}{\sqrt{(1-\bar{\alpha}_{i})\bar{\alpha}_{i}}}\epsilon_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{i},i)+\sqrt{\sigma_{1}^{2}+\sum_{i=2}^{k}\frac{\sigma_{i}^{2}}{\bar{\alpha}_{i-1}}}\bar{\epsilon}_{1}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.6.1" class="ltx_text">Using the closed-form representation of the reparameterization trick, the final denoised data <math id="A2.p2.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\bm{\tau}}^{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝝉</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\bm{\tau}}^{0}</annotation></semantics></math> follows a Gaussian distribution, expressed as <math id="A2.p2.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\bm{\tau}}^{0}\sim\mathcal{N}(\widehat{\mu}_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{k},k),\widehat{\sigma}^{2}\mathbf{I})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>𝝉</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝝉</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝐈</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\bm{\tau}}^{0}\sim\mathcal{N}(\widehat{\mu}_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{k},k),\widehat{\sigma}^{2}\mathbf{I})</annotation></semantics></math>. The mean <math id="A2.p2.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\mu}_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{k},k)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝝉</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\mu}_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{k},k)</annotation></semantics></math> captures the denoising trajectory and is formulated as:</span></p>
<table id="A2.E19" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\mu}_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{k},k)=\frac{1}{\sqrt{\bar{\alpha}_{k}}}\bm{\tau}^{k}-\sum_{i=1}^{k}\frac{1-\alpha_{i}}{\sqrt{(1-\bar{\alpha}_{i})\bar{\alpha}_{i}}}\epsilon_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{i},i)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝝉</mi><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝝉</mi><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em">−</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>𝝉</mi><mi>i</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\mu}_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{k},k)=\frac{1}{\sqrt{\bar{\alpha}_{k}}}\bm{\tau}^{k}-\sum_{i=1}^{k}\frac{1-\alpha_{i}}{\sqrt{(1-\bar{\alpha}_{i})\bar{\alpha}_{i}}}\epsilon_{\theta}(\bm{\tau}^{i},i).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.7.1" class="ltx_text">Similarly, the covariance <math id="A2.p2.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\sigma}^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\sigma}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> accounts for the accumulation of noise over all diffusion steps and is written as:</span></p>
<table id="A2.E20" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A2.E20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{\sigma}^{2}=\sigma_{1}^{2}+\sum_{i=2}^{k}\frac{\sigma_{i}^{2}}{\bar{\alpha}_{i-1}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>σ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo rspace="0.055em">+</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mfrac><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>α</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{\sigma}^{2}=\sigma_{1}^{2}+\sum_{i=2}^{k}\frac{\sigma_{i}^{2}}{\bar{\alpha}_{i-1}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.p2.8.1" class="ltx_text">∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
